00:29:42,800 --> 00:29:47,860
a constraint valley, the ICA vectors point exactly in the direction where the landscape is shifting

521
00:29:47,860 --> 00:29:48,460
the fastest.

522
00:29:48,980 --> 00:29:52,480
They are the natural coordinate axes of the constraint topology.

523
00:29:52,640 --> 00:29:55,600
The grain of the wood perfectly maps the boundaries of the rules.

524
00:29:55,640 --> 00:29:56,000
Exactly.

525
00:29:56,180 --> 00:29:57,180
That is just mind-bending.

